PROJECT OVERVIEW

This project is a prototype AI operating interface inspired by Tony Stark’s JARVIS.

The system allows the user to control the computer using:

• Hand gestures
• Voice commands
• AI assistant logic

The goal is to build a futuristic computer interaction system where a user can control the operating system without touching the keyboard or mouse.

