GESTURE CONTROL SUMMARY

POINT

Purpose: Move mouse cursor

Mechanism: Index finger controls cursor position.

---

CLOSED FIST

Purpose: Mouse click

Mechanism: When fist detected, system triggers a mouse click.

---

TWO FINGER

Purpose: Scroll

Mechanism:

Hand vertical movement determines scroll direction.

Up movement → scroll up
Down movement → scroll down

Scroll system includes:

• smoothing
• jitter filtering
• delta detection

This creates trackpad-like scrolling.

---

THUMB UP

Purpose: Activate cursor

When detected:

Cursor controller becomes active.

---

THUMB DOWN

Purpose: Deactivate cursor

Prevents accidental cursor movement.

